5 revenue works out to about $450,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ADI.q.employees","ADI.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $2.5 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $1.2 billion in short-term investments, and $8.6 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + ShortTermBorrowings). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $4.9 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["ADI.cash.2025","ADI.sti.2025","ADI.debtLong.2025","ADI.debtCurrent.2025","ADI.debtShort.2025"]}]},"fin":{"ADI":{}},"quotes":{"ADI.q.employees":{"c":"ADI","kind":"employees","n":24500,"quote":"As of November 1, 2025, we had approximately 24,500 employees, of whom approximately 13,000 are in engineering roles.","source":"ADI-0000006281-25-000153","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2025-11-25","proof":"9348d81e29a01d4dde0a9b0cb8d3d96b4c7ab325d63857ca5ba1e075732a7d73"}}}